<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Angkasa 6-mth net up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Angkasa 6-mth net up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 26.50    vs	22.34</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     18.0     vs	15.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,078.12    vs     895.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   45.70    vs	28.50</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less  5.44    vs add   0.52</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Angkasa Marketing Bhd. The company distributes Suzuki vehicles in Malaysia.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-23 8911)</p>
</text>
